{
  "info": {
    "name": "ParlayAPI (curated)",
    "description": "ParlayAPI: real-time sports odds API. 30+ sportsbooks and data sources, player props, arbitrage and +EV tools, prediction markets (Kalshi, Polymarket), historical closing lines from 2005. Drop-in compatible with the-odds-api (same endpoint shapes, /v4 paths, ?apiKey= auth). Free tier: 1,000 credits a month, no card required. Docs: https://parlay-api.com/docs\n\nKeyless folders run with no API key at all. For the keyed folder, set the apiKey collection variable. Get a free API key (1,000 credits a month, no card): https://parlay-api.com/signup",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
